/* Spec 003 V11-03: the visitor counter's Pages Function (functions/) and its logic and tests (server/).
   Type-checked only; Cloudflare bundles functions/, and Node runs the tests with built-in type stripping. */
{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "strict": true,
    "target": "ES2023",
    "lib": ["ES2023", "DOM"],
    "module": "esnext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true,
    "verbatimModuleSyntax": true,
    "erasableSyntaxOnly": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "types": ["node"]
  },
  "include": ["server/**/*.ts", "functions/**/*.ts"]
}
